{"3266180": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Void Phantom", "steam_appid": 3266180, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Roguelike Shooter in the Darkness of the Cosmos</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The universe is a silent abyss. And in the abyss, only predators survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Void Phantom</strong> is an adrenaline-fueled roguelike shooter that blends the intensity of classic space shooters with the strategic depth of the roguelike genre. Customize your ship, upgrade your arsenal, and face hordes of enemies, titanic bosses, and cosmic secrets in a procedurally generated universe. Every run is a chance to ascend – or to be forgotten.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story: The Blood of Stars</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Humanity is but a whisper in the roar of the galaxy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are the captain of the <strong>Phantom</strong>, a legendary ship on the edge of known space. Your mission: venture into the <strong>Void</strong>, a mysterious and hostile region where reality itself begins to waver. There, ancient dormant entities awaken. There, the laws of physics are merely suggestions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover the truth behind the Void. Face the guardians of dead stars. And decide the fate of what remains of humanity.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >⚔️ Epic Space Battles</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Real-time combat against enemies driven by a lethal AI. Every boss is a ballistic puzzle: unique patterns, transformative phases, and attacks capable of obliterating an unprepared ship.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🎨 Stunning Pixel Art</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Retro aesthetics enhanced by modern effects: particle explosions, dynamic lighting, and space environments that look hand-painted. Every frame is a painting of war.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🛠️ Total Customization</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your ship, your style. Beam weapons, piercing cannons, energy shields, black hole generators – choose from dozens of modules and craft a custom cosmic weapon of destruction tailored to you.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >♾️ Roguelike Progression</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No two runs are the same. Procedurally generated levels, random upgrades, and permanent choices shape your experience. Die, learn, upgrade – and return stronger.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🏆 Challenges &amp; Achievements</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Side missions, secret objectives, and timed challenges. Unlock exclusive rewards and prove you are a true <strong>Phantom Legend</strong>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >👥 Challenge Your Friends in the Arena</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The most unpredictable threat is another human. Challenge your friends in intense 1v1 PvP battles within the Arena, where your customized arsenal clashes against another will. The Void has never been so competitive.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🎵 Immersive Soundtrack</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Audio that pulses with the action. Orchestral melodies alternate with aggressive synths, accompanying you through every exploration, escape, and triumph.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore the Unknown</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The cosmos of Void Phantom is not a static backdrop – it's a living character.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover hidden sectors, side missions, ancient ruins, and lore fragments scattered among the stars. Every corner of the universe holds a secret. And every secret could be your ruin... or your salvation.</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Roguelike Shooter in the Darkness of the Cosmos</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The universe is a silent abyss. And in the abyss, only predators survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Void Phantom</strong> is an adrenaline-fueled roguelike shooter that blends the intensity of classic space shooters with the strategic depth of the roguelike genre. Customize your ship, upgrade your arsenal, and face hordes of enemies, titanic bosses, and cosmic secrets in a procedurally generated universe. Every run is a chance to ascend – or to be forgotten.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story: The Blood of Stars</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Humanity is but a whisper in the roar of the galaxy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are the captain of the <strong>Phantom</strong>, a legendary ship on the edge of known space. Your mission: venture into the <strong>Void</strong>, a mysterious and hostile region where reality itself begins to waver. There, ancient dormant entities awaken. There, the laws of physics are merely suggestions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover the truth behind the Void. Face the guardians of dead stars. And decide the fate of what remains of humanity.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >⚔️ Epic Space Battles</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Real-time combat against enemies driven by a lethal AI. Every boss is a ballistic puzzle: unique patterns, transformative phases, and attacks capable of obliterating an unprepared ship.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🎨 Stunning Pixel Art</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Retro aesthetics enhanced by modern effects: particle explosions, dynamic lighting, and space environments that look hand-painted. Every frame is a painting of war.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🛠️ Total Customization</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your ship, your style. Beam weapons, piercing cannons, energy shields, black hole generators – choose from dozens of modules and craft a custom cosmic weapon of destruction tailored to you.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >♾️ Roguelike Progression</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No two runs are the same. Procedurally generated levels, random upgrades, and permanent choices shape your experience. Die, learn, upgrade – and return stronger.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🏆 Challenges &amp; Achievements</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Side missions, secret objectives, and timed challenges. Unlock exclusive rewards and prove you are a true <strong>Phantom Legend</strong>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >👥 Challenge Your Friends in the Arena</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The most unpredictable threat is another human. Challenge your friends in intense 1v1 PvP battles within the Arena, where your customized arsenal clashes against another will. The Void has never been so competitive.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🎵 Immersive Soundtrack</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Audio that pulses with the action. Orchestral melodies alternate with aggressive synths, accompanying you through every exploration, escape, and triumph.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore the Unknown</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The cosmos of Void Phantom is not a static backdrop – it's a living character.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover hidden sectors, side missions, ancient ruins, and lore fragments scattered among the stars. Every corner of the universe holds a secret. And every secret could be your ruin... or your salvation.</p>", "short_description": "A space roguelike shooter with epic naval battles. Pilot your ship, face ruthless enemies and massive bosses, and customize your fleet with devastating weapons.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3266180/header.jpg?t=1781290052", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3266180/54dabc466dd74e97e1f0541cdc253d9232a69105/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1781290052", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3266180/54dabc466dd74e97e1f0541cdc253d9232a69105/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1781290052", "website": "https://rpxgames.win/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br